# What stays out of the published archive.
#
# The tape parity: the racing and shooter tapes played on the core on every
# target, run from this repository by tool/digest_platforms.sh. It imports
# the demos' content and the genres, which this package does not depend on,
# and pub's dependency check reads every Dart file that would be published.
tool/tape_parity/
build/
.dart_tool/
